<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport Resource cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport Resource cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Wednesday it had reduced its rating for Freeport-McMoRan Resource Partners LP to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Donald Pattison wrote in a report that the New Orleans company's quarter that ended Dec 31 was &quot;modestly better than expected.&quot;  He cut his estimate for first quarter 1997 earnings per share to $0.40 from $0.50.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened down 3/8 to 18-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
